Package: flickos-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: FlickOS's GTK themes
 FlickOS-Arc-Dark and FlickOS-Arc: arc-theme's GTK 3 and GTK 4 themes with
 FlickOS's corners (6 px on controls, 8 px on pop-ups, dialogs and the window),
 a header bar whose height is set in one place, and a sidebar in the window's
 own colors in the light theme. The colors are Arc's. Built from arc-theme
 20221218's Sass (src/, debian/README.source), so it does not need arc-theme
 installed, and both can be installed together.
